{"schemaVersion":"public-read-v0.1","items":[{"publicId":"public-rss-b16ce7793577755b972f86be9d276825d27c075eeb00ce51cb7674cf4e69e615","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"布里亚托雷质疑摩纳哥大奖赛上诉公正性，称法官与迈凯伦关系密切","summaryZh":"Alpine F1车队负责人弗拉维奥·布里亚托雷在蒙扎的新闻发布会上质疑摩纳哥大奖赛结果的上诉程序的公正性，声称一名法官与迈凯伦车队关系密切。皮埃尔·加斯利是摩纳哥站中因超速被罚的车手之一，但后来发现该处罚源于FOM的错误测量。加斯利因此失去了第三名的位置。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T06:34:15.240Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-04T14:18:01.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-2.motorsport.com/images/amp/YP743je2/s6/flavio-briatore-alpine.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":223791,"altZh":"布里亚托雷质疑摩纳哥大奖赛上诉公正性，称法官与迈凯伦关系密切"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/flavio-briatore-questions-monaco-gp-appeal-integrity-in-extraordinary-monza-press-conference/10852228/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-16bf6b6e11ef5dd4908f0c3b93f89ebc0f1f9c64c067bd47015e786338b7185e","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"红牛更新伊萨克·哈贾尔恢复时间表","summaryZh":"红牛车队领队劳伦特·梅基斯表示，伊萨克·哈贾尔需要更多时间从手腕伤势中恢复，可能无法在西班牙大奖赛重返F1。哈贾尔在夏季休赛期训练中受伤，因此缺席了赞德福特和蒙扎的F1周末。红牛已由利亚姆·劳森替补，角田裕毅则相应调整。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T07:47:55.572Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-04T13:33:20.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/25dLeVx0/s6/isack-hadjar-red-bull-racing.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":182485,"altZh":"红牛更新伊萨克·哈贾尔恢复时间表"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/red-bull-gives-update-on-isack-hadjars-recovery-t