ngs-after-monaco-gp-ruling-alpine-loses-out/10852179/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-788cc0ede780c19ffb92e6d1b3c4559a58924b7db93abc5c29073921e4196cd6","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"兰多·诺里斯新赛车团队收到“数百份求职申请”","summaryZh":"兰多·诺里斯表示，他希望建立自己的初级车队和车手发展计划，以帮助缺乏资金支持的人才进入F1。诺里斯于周三宣布了两个独立项目：单座赛车车队LN4 Fusion和LN4 Legacy计划，后者旨在通过FIA的阶梯赛事支持年轻车手的职业生涯。LN4 Fusion将由前Prema长期成员运营。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T06:16:43.933Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-04T12:32:47.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-3.motorsport.com/images/amp/YpbAeXJ0/s6/lando-norris-mclaren.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":251231,"altZh":"兰多·诺里斯新赛车团队收到“数百份求职申请”"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/lando-norris-new-race-team-received-a-few-hundred-job-requests/10852113/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-2fa2d77fda8fb67f29bd5a2096579cd25c09b3428587039783334e70a105efce","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"前F1车手警告：迈凯伦势不可挡，诺里斯冲击2026冠军","summaryZh":"前F1车手胡安·帕布罗·蒙托亚认为，迈凯伦在2026赛季冠军争夺中已变得“难以阻挡”，信心日益增强。卫冕冠军兰多·诺里斯在匈牙利和荷兰大奖赛连续两场胜利后，本周末将出战意大利大奖赛。尽管诺里斯仍落后梅赛德斯车手基米·安东内利83分，但迈凯伦的势头迅猛。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T06:26:05.858Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-04T12:32:26.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-2.motorsport.com/images/amp/YWKAjNVY/s6/lando-norris-mclaren.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":245222,"altZh":"前F1车手警告：迈凯伦势不可挡，诺里斯冲击2026冠军"}